      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ABISSI (1) bolted in two back before jumping favourite and getting too far back, finishing strongly to end up 0.8L off the winner. He gets a nice weight swing on I LOVE YA MONEY who beat him there, and a better draw this time should see him closer in the run. Can get back to winning ways. I LOVE YA MONEY (2) beat ABISSI two back and landed the knockout blow last week on the 7-day turnaround again, winning by 0.4L. He meets ABISSI worse at the weights this time, but he's racing in top order and has enough tactical speed to offset the draw. Expecting him to play a leading role again. STARWALKER (4) comes through the same race that All Grunt won last start where he was behind ABISSI and ILYM. Will need some luck to turn the tables, but his recent form shows that he's not too far away. LIEN HYPHEN (6) finds the right race today. ROMMEO (3) is next best.",
